<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Bend</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Bend, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value to handleless German luxury — backed by 23+ years of hands-on dealer support. We offer protected territory, line training, and the design and merchandising help your team needs to win high-desert and resort projects.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom stains, paint, and wood species for refined mountain-modern kitchens, with strong dealer margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access for clean contemporary builds.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless European fronts for high-end resort and luxury homes, with protected territory.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Semi-custom value for the area's strong new construction.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="bend-market-opportunity">The Bend Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>From NorthWest Crossing and Awbrey Butte to Tetherow and the resort communities, Bend's high-desert market favors mountain-modern design with Pacific-Northwest natural materials — warm woods, matte finishes, natural stone, and clean lines. Rapid growth and transplant demand have pushed interest in <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> construction and handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> kitchens, balanced by warm <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh</a> stains and two-tone schemes — a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the right lines.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales backs Bend dealers with hands-on sales training, 2020/Winner design and quoting support, showroom display programs, and ongoing business development. We work alongside your team to move projects from concept to order.</p>

